{"seq":2,"slug":"server-side-impl-openclaw","title":"openclaw mcp serve：multi-tenant 隔离的 server 实现","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/mcp-bidirectional/server-side-impl-openclaw","wordCount":1343,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"openclaw-mcp-serve-multi-tenant-隔离的-server-实现\">openclaw mcp serve：multi-tenant 隔离的 server 实现</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>openclaw mcp serve</code> 与 Hermes 一样把自己的核心能力暴露为 MCP server，但承担一项 Hermes 不需要解决的额外复杂度：<strong>multi-tenant 隔离</strong>。OpenClaw 是为聊天平台代接而生——一个用户实例同时维护数个甚至数十个 chat-platform 通道（Slack / Discord / Lark / 自建 IM），每个通道独立一个 tenant，各有自己的 secret store / persona / 历史消息 / outbound webhook。Server 暴露的每个 tool 都要在调用时识别 tenant 上下文、在隔离边界里执行、把跨 tenant 数据泄漏防死。stdio-only 而非可选 HTTP 也是为了同样的理由——multi-tenant 加 HTTP 让 audience 校验复杂度爆炸。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[Claude Code] --&gt; S[stdio JSON-RPC]&#10;  S --&gt; O[openclaw mcp serve]&#10;  O --&gt; T1[persona_switch]&#10;  O --&gt; T2[message_route]&#10;  O --&gt; T3[tenant_list]&#10;  O --&gt; T4[channel_send]&#10;  T1 --&gt; TM[Tenant manager]&#10;  T2 --&gt; TM&#10;  T4 --&gt; TM&#10;  TM --&gt; K1[(tenant_a secret)]&#10;  TM --&gt; K2[(tenant_b secret)]&#10;  TM --&gt; K3[(tenant_c secret)]\">flowchart LR\n  A[Claude Code] --&gt; S[stdio JSON-RPC]\n  S --&gt; O[openclaw mcp serve]\n  O --&gt; T1[persona_switch]\n  O --&gt; T2[message_route]\n  O --&gt; T3[tenant_list]\n  O --&gt; T4[channel_send]\n  T1 --&gt; TM[Tenant manager]\n  T2 --&gt; TM\n  T4 --&gt; TM\n  TM --&gt; K1[(tenant_a secret)]\n  TM --&gt; K2[(tenant_b secret)]\n  TM --&gt; K3[(tenant_c secret)]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计选择</th>\n<th>与 Hermes 差异</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>必带 tenant_id</td>\n<td>Hermes 无 tenant 概念</td>\n<td>multi-tenant 强隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅 stdio</td>\n<td>Hermes 可选 HTTP</td>\n<td>audience 校验过复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写 tool 多于读</td>\n<td>Hermes 主要 read</td>\n<td>聊天工具本质是 write-heavy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每 tool audit log</td>\n<td>Hermes 仅 curator log</td>\n<td>合规 / 审计要求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"四个核心-tool\">四个核心 tool</h2><h3 id=\"persona_switch\">persona_switch</h3><p>切换当前活跃 persona。Persona 是 OpenClaw 把&quot;角色 + 价值观 + 语气&quot;打包的概念，与 SOUL.md 一对一。Input：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tenant_id&quot;: &quot;tn_lark_team_a&quot;,&#10;  &quot;persona_id&quot;: &quot;tech-lead&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ttl_minutes&quot;: 120&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tenant_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tn_lark_team_a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"persona_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tech-lead\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ttl_minutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">120</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Output：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;active_persona&quot;: &quot;tech-lead&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tenant_id&quot;: &quot;tn_lark_team_a&quot;,&#10;  &quot;expires_at&quot;: &quot;2026-05-14T15:30:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;soul_path&quot;: &quot;.openclaw/personas/tech-lead/SOUL.md&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"active_persona\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tech-lead\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tenant_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tn_lark_team_a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"expires_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-05-14T15:30:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"soul_path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".openclaw/personas/tech-lead/SOUL.md\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ttl 让&quot;切换 persona 帮忙写一封正式邮件后自动切回&quot;成为可能，避免 stale persona 污染后续消息。</p>\n<h3 id=\"message_route\">message_route</h3><p>把一条入站消息按 5 级 lookup 路由到合适的 persona + skill。这是 OpenClaw 最核心的工作 unit。Input：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tenant_id&quot;: &quot;tn_lark_team_a&quot;,&#10;  &quot;from&quot;: &quot;u_3ab8&quot;,&#10;  &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;ch_proj_alpha&quot;,&#10;  &quot;content&quot;: &quot;周报怎么填本周 OKR 进度?&quot;,&#10;  &quot;thread_id&quot;: &quot;t_91f&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tenant_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tn_lark_team_a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"u_3ab8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ch_proj_alpha\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"周报怎么填本周 OKR 进度?\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"thread_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"t_91f\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Output：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;routed_to&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;persona&quot;: &quot;tech-lead&quot;,&#10;    &quot;skill&quot;: &quot;weekly-report-base-to-doc&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lookup_path&quot;: [&quot;thread&quot;, &quot;channel&quot;, &quot;tenant&quot;],&#10;    &quot;matched_level&quot;: &quot;channel&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;invocation_id&quot;: &quot;inv_22de&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"routed_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"persona\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tech-lead\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"skill\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"weekly-report-base-to-doc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lookup_path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"thread\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tenant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"matched_level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"channel\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"invocation_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"inv_22de\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>lookup_path</code> 字段展示 OpenClaw 5 级路由经过了哪些层级（peer → parent → guild/roles → account → channel → fallback）才命中。5 级路由细节见 <a href=\"../multi-tenant-personas/\"><code>../5_multi-tenant-personas/</code></a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"tenant_list\">tenant_list</h3><p>列出当前用户所有 tenant 的元数据。Input：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{ &quot;filter&quot;: { &quot;platform&quot;: &quot;lark&quot; } }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"filter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"platform\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lark\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Output：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tenants&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;tenant_id&quot;: &quot;tn_lark_team_a&quot;,&#10;      &quot;platform&quot;: &quot;lark&quot;,&#10;      &quot;display_name&quot;: &quot;Team A 飞书&quot;,&#10;      &quot;channel_count&quot;: 14,&#10;      &quot;last_active&quot;: &quot;2026-05-14T11:23:00Z&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tenants\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"tenant_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tn_lark_team_a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"platform\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lark\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"display_name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Team A 飞书\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"channel_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"last_active\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-05-14T11:23:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>提供给 client 的目的是让 client（如 Claude Code）能问&quot;我现在有哪些 tenant 在线&quot;，从而做 cross-tenant 协调时显式列出。注意 output 不包含任何 secret——secret 是 server-side opaque。</p>\n<h3 id=\"channel_send\">channel_send</h3><p>把一条消息从 OpenClaw 经指定 tenant 发到指定 channel。Input：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tenant_id&quot;: &quot;tn_lark_team_a&quot;,&#10;  &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;ch_proj_alpha&quot;,&#10;  &quot;content_type&quot;: &quot;text&quot;,&#10;  &quot;content&quot;: &quot;本周周报已生成,详见: &lt;link&gt;&quot;,&#10;  &quot;persona&quot;: &quot;tech-lead&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tenant_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tn_lark_team_a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ch_proj_alpha\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"content_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"本周周报已生成,详见: &#x3C;link>\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"persona\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tech-lead\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Output：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;message_id&quot;: &quot;msg_8a4e&quot;,&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;sent&quot;,&#10;  &quot;delivered_at&quot;: &quot;2026-05-14T13:30:14Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;audit_log_id&quot;: &quot;alog_7f9d&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"message_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"msg_8a4e\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"delivered_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-05-14T13:30:14Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"audit_log_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alog_7f9d\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每次 send 都生成 audit_log_id 进合规日志，包含 tenant / persona / channel / content_hash / sender_chain。后续可按 audit_log_id 查整条消息的来龙去脉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"multi-tenant-隔离的-server-端实现\">multi-tenant 隔离的 server 端实现</h2><h3 id=\"per-tenant-secret-store\">per-tenant secret store</h3><p>每个 tenant 的 platform API token 加密存储在独立 keystore 条目：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  T[tool 调用 with tenant_id] --&gt; A[Auth resolver]&#10;  A --&gt; K[(Keystore)]&#10;  K --&gt; S[Decrypt tenant secret]&#10;  S --&gt; P[Platform API call]&#10;  P --&gt; R[Response]\">flowchart LR\n  T[tool 调用 with tenant_id] --&gt; A[Auth resolver]\n  A --&gt; K[(Keystore)]\n  K --&gt; S[Decrypt tenant secret]\n  S --&gt; P[Platform API call]\n  P --&gt; R[Response]</pre><p>Keystore 默认用 OS 原生 secure storage（Keychain on macOS / Secret Service on Linux / DPAPI on Windows）。Server 进程在启动时不解密所有 secret——按需 decrypt，使用完毕立即从内存抹除（zeroize）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def call_with_tenant(tool, args):&#10;    tenant_id = args.pop(&quot;tenant_id&quot;)&#10;    secret = keystore.decrypt(tenant_id)  # 临时持有&#10;    try:&#10;        return tool.execute(secret, args)&#10;    finally:&#10;        secret.zeroize()  # 立即清内存\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> call_with_tenant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tool, args):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tenant_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> args.pop(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tenant_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    secret </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> keystore.decrypt(tenant_id)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 临时持有</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tool.execute(secret, args)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        secret.zeroize()  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 立即清内存</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种&quot;短暂持有 + 立即清除&quot;策略让&quot;server 进程 memory dump 一次最多泄漏当前正在用的一个 tenant&quot;，而不是所有 tenant。</p>\n<h3 id=\"audit-log\">audit log</h3><p>每个 tool call 都写一条 audit log，schema：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>log_id</td>\n<td>UUID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tenant_id</td>\n<td>对应 tenant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tool_name</td>\n<td>调用的 tool</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>input_hash</td>\n<td>input args 的 SHA256（不存原文）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>outcome</td>\n<td>success / failure / partial</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sender_chain</td>\n<td>触发链（client → server → platform）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>duration_ms</td>\n<td>延时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>timestamp</td>\n<td>UTC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>audit log 写 append-only file（默认 <code>~/.openclaw/audit/&lt;tenant&gt;/YYYY-MM-DD.ndjson</code>），加上 HMAC chain 防篡改——每条 log 的 hmac 包含前一条 hmac，整条 chain 中间被改会断链。</p>\n<h3 id=\"防跨-tenant-泄漏\">防跨 tenant 泄漏</h3><p>最常见的泄漏路径是 server 内部 tool 调用时把 tenant_a 的 context 错传给 tenant_b。OpenClaw 的防御：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>防御层</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型系统</td>\n<td>TenantId 是 nominal type，不能与字符串混用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源 prefix</td>\n<td>SQLite 表名 / 文件路径包含 tenant_id 前缀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试断言</td>\n<td>集成测试有 cross-tenant red-team case</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时检查</td>\n<td>tool 入口断言 args.tenant_id == ctx.tenant_id</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四道防线让&quot;逻辑错误导致泄漏&quot;概率近零。</p>\n<h2 id=\"stdio-only-的设计\">stdio-only 的设计</h2><p>OpenClaw 比 Hermes 更严格：<strong>不提供 HTTP 模式</strong>。原因：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HTTP + multi-tenant</td>\n<td>必须每 request 验 tenant + token + audience，复杂度爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络层</td>\n<td>截获一次 token 可能泄漏多个 tenant secret</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署模型</td>\n<td>用户期望&quot;个人工具不开 port&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨机器场景需要 SSH tunnel 后用 stdio：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 远端机器&#10;ssh -R 0:openclaw-mcp.sock my-laptop&#10;# 本地 Claude Code 把 mcp 配置指向 unix domain socket\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 远端机器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ssh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -R</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 0:openclaw-mcp.sock</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-laptop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 本地 Claude Code 把 mcp 配置指向 unix domain socket</span></span></code></pre></div><p>不优雅但安全。OpenClaw 团队的判断是：multi-tenant 工具暴露 HTTP 的合规风险大于 cross-machine 便利。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tier-1-client-接入示例\">Tier 1 client 接入示例</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# ~/.codex/config.toml&#10;[[mcp_servers]]&#10;name = &quot;openclaw&quot;&#10;command = &quot;openclaw&quot;&#10;args = [&quot;mcp&quot;, &quot;serve&quot;]&#10;env = { OPENCLAW_HOME = &quot;~/.openclaw&quot; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># ~/.codex/config.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[[mcp_servers]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name = \"openclaw\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>command = \"openclaw\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>args = [\"mcp\", \"serve\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>env = { OPENCLAW_HOME = \"~/.openclaw\" }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Claude Code 配置同结构。Server 启动后会读 <code>~/.openclaw/tenants.yml</code> 注册所有 tenant，每个 tenant 的 secret 已经在初次配置时进 keystore。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-hermes-server-的对照\">与 Hermes server 的对照</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>hermes mcp serve</th>\n<th>openclaw mcp serve</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>tool 数</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tool 主语</td>\n<td>memory / curator / persona / skill</td>\n<td>persona / message / tenant / channel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Read/Write 比</td>\n<td>4:1</td>\n<td>1:1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>必带 tenant_id</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP 可选</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Audit log 粒度</td>\n<td>curator 周期</td>\n<td>每 tool call</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>互补关系：Claude Code 同时接 Hermes 与 OpenClaw 时，可以&quot;从 Hermes 拉用户偏好，从 OpenClaw 拉聊天上下文，拼成完整 prompt&quot;，详见 <a href=\"../../../bridges/\"><code>../../../03_bridges/</code></a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>忘了传 tenant_id</strong>：所有 tool 都必带，传空字符串或漏字段 server 直接 reject。</li>\n<li><strong>同一 client 在不同 tool call 间 tenant 切换</strong>：是允许的，但 server 不维护&quot;上一次 tenant&quot;状态——每次 call 都要显式带。</li>\n<li><strong>audit log 文件膨胀</strong>：每天一个 ndjson，~10MB / tenant / 高活跃日。建议 90 天后 gzip 归档。</li>\n<li><strong>跨机器接入忘记 SSH tunnel</strong>：openclaw 不开 HTTP，TCP 直连不存在。错误信息明确指向 stdio-only。</li>\n<li><strong>keystore 跨用户共享</strong>：多用户共用一台机器时 OS keystore 默认按 user 隔离，不会泄漏。但 root 仍能读所有 user keystore——多用户机请用文件级加密 + per-user 密码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>OpenClaw MCP server 在 Hermes server 的设计上叠加了&quot;multi-tenant 强隔离&quot;维度：per-tenant secret keystore + 每 tool call audit log + 类型系统/资源 prefix 多层防泄漏 + stdio-only 拒绝 HTTP。4 个 tool（persona_switch / message_route / tenant_list / channel_send）覆盖聊天平台代接的所有核心动作，每个都按 tenant_id 隔离执行。这套设计让&quot;一个个人 agent 同时管十个聊天 channel&quot;在工程上 viable。下一篇看 hermes 与 openclaw 这种&quot;同进程既作 server 又作 client&quot;的双角色架构如何实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"openclaw mcp serve：multi-tenant 隔离的 server 实现","id":"openclaw-mcp-serve-multi-tenant-隔离的-server-实现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四个核心 tool","id":"四个核心-tool"},{"level":3,"text":"persona_switch","id":"persona_switch"},{"level":3,"text":"message_route","id":"message_route"},{"level":3,"text":"tenant_list","id":"tenant_list"},{"level":3,"text":"channel_send","id":"channel_send"},{"level":2,"text":"multi-tenant 隔离的 server 端实现","id":"multi-tenant-隔离的-server-端实现"},{"level":3,"text":"per-tenant secret store","id":"per-tenant-secret-store"},{"level":3,"text":"audit log","id":"audit-log"},{"level":3,"text":"防跨 tenant 泄漏","id":"防跨-tenant-泄漏"},{"level":2,"text":"stdio-only 的设计","id":"stdio-only-的设计"},{"level":2,"text":"Tier 1 client 接入示例","id":"tier-1-client-接入示例"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Hermes server 的对照","id":"与-hermes-server-的对照"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"hermes mcp serve：server 端实现","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/mcp-bidirectional/server-side-impl-hermes"},"next":{"title":"同进程双角色：server thread + client thread","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/mcp-bidirectional/dual-role-process-architecture"}}